---
// Backdrop for the standalone gateway page (/hub): the interactive node
// network and the frosted layer over it. Render it inside a `relative isolate` element marked [data-network]:
// that element sizes the canvas and receives the pointer. Wired up by
// src/scripts/gateway.ts.
---

<canvas
    data-network-canvas
    data-intro
    data-intro-backdrop
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none -z-30"
></canvas>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-background/20 backdrop-blur-[5px] pointer-events-none -z-20"></div>
